# interplay_limits_root_wait_alias_dies: The root waits on child 2's first stamp (bit 0); child 32 then waits on it too, marks bit 0 (1 << 32 is 1 << 0), and the assert aborts the host. Child 32 reaches its wait only after an 8 MiB NOP, so the death lands in the wait after its doorbell.
